  ["|cffffd100Step 3.|r Open this page in your browser (click it, Ctrl+C, paste it in the address bar),"] = "|cffffd100第 3 步。|r 在瀏覽器中開啟此頁面（點選它，Ctrl+C，貼上到位址列），",
  ["Download (CurseForge)"] = "下載（CurseForge）",
  ["Below max level, and for a new character's starter spec, Blizzard's Assisted Combat leads while you know few of the spells the priority list expects; DMGAssist's list takes over by itself as you learn more. New spells without a key and unspent talent points get one chat line. Combat > Leveling."] = "在滿級之前，以及新角色的初始專精，只要你只會優先順序列表所需技能中的一小部分，就由暴雪的輔助戰鬥主導；隨著你學會更多，DMGAssist 的列表會自動接手。沒有按鍵的新技能和未分配的天賦點會在聊天框提示一行。戰鬥 > 升級。",
  ["Fits your UI"] = "融入你的介面",
  ["Move the HUD in Blizzard's Edit Mode. Masque skins the icons. With a controller, keybinds show as its buttons (Display > Controller button names). Titan Panel and ElvUI data texts get a DMGAssist launcher. Addon authors: DMGAssistAPI."] = "在暴雪的編輯模式中移動 HUD。Masque 可美化圖示。使用控制器時，按鍵顯示為控制器按鈕（顯示 > 控制器按鍵名稱）。Titan Panel 和 ElvUI 資訊文字會有 DMGAssist 啟動器。插件作者：DMGAssistAPI。",
  ["DMGAssist is off for %s. /dmga spec on turns it back on."] = "DMGAssist 已在 %s 關閉。/dmga spec on 可重新開啟。",
  ["DMGAssist is on for %s."] = "DMGAssist 已在 %s 開啟。",
  ["DMGAssist on or off for the spec you are in (an alt's healing spec, for example)"] = "為當前專精開啟或關閉 DMGAssist（例如小號的治療專精）",
  ["Like your action bars: an icon turns red when your target is out of that spell's range, and slot 1 turns blue when you are short of resource for it."] = "和快捷列一樣：目標超出該技能射程時圖示變紅；資源不足時第 1 格變藍。",
  ["Use DMGAssist on this spec"] = "在此專精使用 DMGAssist",
  ["Out of range and resource colors"] = "射程和資源顏色",
  ["list recommended spells that have no keybind"] = "列出可推薦但沒有繫結按鍵的技能",
  ["test the defensive alert (8 seconds)"] = "模擬首領插件要求減傷（8 秒），檢查是否顯示",
  ["refresh keybinds"] = "重新整理按鍵",
  ["report an issue or give feedback: describe it, copy the report, open the issue page"] = "報告問題或提出反饋：描述問題、複製報告、開啟 issue 頁面",
  ["save a full decision trace for troubleshooting"] = "儲存完整的決策記錄用於排查問題",
  ["test the interrupt alert, Assisted Combat, or boss mod detection"] = "測試打斷、暴雪助手和首領插件檢測",
  ["the three setup questions again (where, how big, when to show)"] = "再次回答三個設定問題（位置、大小、何時顯示）",
  ["Use DMGAssist on %s"] = "在%s使用 DMGAssist",
  ["Reload the interface now to switch the language?"] = "現在重新載入介面以切換語言？",
  ["Reload now"] = "立即重載",
  ["Later"] = "稍後",
  ["Learned timing"] = "已學習的計時",
  ["Forget learned timing"] = "清除已學習的計時",
  ["DMGAssist learns how long your cooldowns really take, including talents, gear and haste it can't see, and which spells to leave to Blizzard's assistant. It's saved for your whole account and gets better as you play. Forget it to start over, for example after a big talent or gear change. Your settings are kept."] = "DMGAssist 會學習你的冷卻實際需要多久（包括它看不到的天賦、裝備和加速），以及哪些法術交給暴雪的輔助戰鬥來判斷。資料保存在整個帳號中，玩得越多越準確。想重新開始時可以清除，例如大幅更換天賦或裝備之後。你的設定會保留。",
  ["Learned cooldown timing forgotten. DMGAssist learns again from your next fight."] = "已清除學習到的冷卻計時。DMGAssist 將從下一場戰鬥開始重新學習。",
  ["Not in combat: try again after the fight."] = "戰鬥中無法操作：請在戰鬥結束後重試。",
  ["forget learned cooldown timing and start learning again"] = "清除學習到的冷卻計時並重新學習",
  ["Slot 1 changes"] = "第1格切換",
  ["Steady (recommended)"] = "穩定（推薦）",
  ["Fast"] = "快速",
  ["Steady: once you're about to press, slot 1 stays put; a spell that becomes ready at that moment shows in slot 2 and moves up after your press. Fast: slot 1 follows every change sooner, for players who react quickly."] = "穩定：在你即將按鍵時，第1格保持不變；此刻剛好就緒的法術顯示在第2格，按鍵後再上移。快速：第1格更早跟隨每次變化，適合反應快的玩家。",
  ["A dark edge around the letters keeps them readable on bright icons."] = "文字周圍的深色描邊讓它們在明亮的圖示上也清晰可讀。",
  ["A dark panel behind the icons."] = "圖示後面的深色底板。",
  ["A glow around slot 1. Only slot 1 moves, so it always draws your eye first."] = "第1格周圍的光效。只有第1格會動，所以它總是最先吸引你的目光。",
  ["A line around the frame."] = "框架周圍的線條。",
  ["A pick DMGAssist isn't sure about (the game hides a value it needs) is shown slightly faded."] = "DMGAssist 不確定的選擇（遊戲隱藏了所需的數值）會以略淡的樣子顯示。",
  ["A small gold-edged icon on slot 1 for an on-use trinket or a potion, when it's time to use it. Quieter than the red one: worth pressing, never urgent."] = "第1格上的金色邊框小圖示，用於該使用的主動飾品或藥水。比紅色的低調：值得按，但從不緊急。",
  ["A small red-edged icon on slot 1 for everything that keeps you alive, for every class: defensive cooldowns, self-heals, tank mitigation like Ironfur. It pulses while you need it now."] = "第1格上的紅色邊框小圖示，用於所有職業保命的一切：防禦冷卻、自我治療、坦克減傷（如鐵鬃）。需要立即使用時會閃動。",
  ["A sound for each kind of alert, so you hear it even when you're not looking. Choose None to silence one."] = "每種提醒都有一個聲音，即使沒在看也能聽到。選擇「無」可將其靜音。",
  ["A thin bar under slot 1 that empties with your global cooldown."] = "第1格下方隨共用冷卻減少的細條。",
  ["Action bars and keybinds"] = "快捷列和按鍵",
  ["Alerts and effects"] = "提醒和效果",
  ["All DMGAssist sounds on or off."] = "開啟或關閉 DMGAssist 的所有聲音。",
  ["Answer the first-time questions again, bind keys, or start over."] = "重新回答首次設定的問題、繫結按鍵或從頭開始。",
  ["Before big hits and when your health is low, a defensive cooldown appears in the red-edged defensive icon on slot 1, pulsing."] = "在大傷害之前以及血量低時，防禦技能會出現在第1格的紅色邊框防禦圖示中並閃動。",
  ["Blizzard's Assisted Combat"] = "暴雪的輔助戰鬥",
  ["DBM, BigWigs and LittleWigs warn about upcoming hits, adds and casts, so defensives and interrupts come on time."] = "DBM、BigWigs 和 LittleWigs 會預警即將到來的傷害、小怪和施法，讓防禦和打斷及時出現。",
  ["Defensive icon (staying alive)"] = "防禦圖示（保命）",
  ["Discipline Priest: Atonement"] = "戒律牧師：救贖",
  ["Extra space between slot 1 and slot 2, so slot 1 stands apart and its small icons have room."] = "第1格和第2格之間的額外間距，讓第1格更突出，其小圖示也有空間。",
  ["For characters below max level, or with talents far from the usual build."] = "適用於未滿等或天賦與常見配置相差很大的角色。",
  ["For tanks: how many stacks of your mitigation buff are up (Guardian Druid: Ironfur), counted from your casts."] = "坦克用：你的減傷增益有多少層（守護德魯伊：鐵鬃），根據你的施法計數。",
  ["Frame and title"] = "框架和標題",
  ["Getting started"] = "開始使用",
  ["Healing spells in your own kit, for damage dealers and tanks (not healer rotations)."] = "你自身技能中的治療法術，適用於輸出和坦克（不是治療循環）。",
  ["Hide the icons outside combat (they still show with an enemy targeted, if the next option is on)."] = "脫戰時隱藏圖示（若開啟下一選項，選取敵人時仍會顯示）。",
  ["Hide the icons when you don't need them."] = "不需要時隱藏圖示。",
  ["Hide the icons while you're in a vehicle (one with its own action bar)."] = "在載具（帶有自己快捷列的）中時隱藏圖示。",
  ["How DMGAssist decides between the single-target and the multi-target rotation."] = "DMGAssist 如何在單體循環和多目標循環之間選擇。",
  ["How big the icons are and the space between them. To move them, unlock on the first page and drag, or use Blizzard's Edit Mode."] = "圖示的大小和間距。要移動它們，請在第一頁解鎖後拖曳，或使用暴雪的編輯模式。",
  ["How dark the background panel is."] = "背景底板的深淺。",
  ["How many icons: slot 1 is the spell to press now, slots 2 and 3 are what comes after it."] = "顯示幾個圖示：第1格是現在要按的法術，第2、3格是之後的。",
  ["How many spells are shown, and which kinds of spells DMGAssist may suggest."] = "顯示多少個法術，以及 DMGAssist 可以推薦哪些類型的法術。",
  ["How solid slots 2 and 3 are. A little lower keeps your eye on slot 1."] = "第2、3格的不透明度。稍低一點能讓視線停在第1格。",
  ["How solid the whole HUD is: lower lets you see through it."] = "整個介面的不透明度：越低越能看穿。",
  ["How the icons tell you when to press, and what needs your attention most."] = "圖示如何提示你何時按鍵，以及什麼最需要你注意。",
  ["How visible that line is."] = "該線條的可見程度。",
  ["In combat the game hides some values from addons (combo points, for example). How to handle them."] = "戰鬥中遊戲會對插件隱藏一些數值（例如連擊點數）。如何處理它們。",
  ["In combat, at or below this much health a defensive is suggested."] = "戰鬥中，生命值低於或等於此值時會推薦防禦技能。",
  ["Items icon (trinkets and potions)"] = "物品圖示（飾品和藥水）",
  ["Its size, as a percentage of slot 1. Larger also covers more of slot 1: move it out with the sliders below."] = "大小，為第1格的百分比。越大也會遮住更多第1格：用下面的滑桿把它移開。",
  ["Keybinds and spell names"] = "按鍵和法術名稱",
  ["Move down / up"] = "向下 / 向上移動",
  ["Move left / right"] = "向左 / 向右移動",
  ["NOW above slot 1 and NEXT above slots 2 and 3."] = "第1格上方顯示「現在」，第2、3格上方顯示「下一個」。",
  ["Nudges it down (below 0) or up (above 0), in pixels, so it doesn't cover slot 1."] = "以像素向下（小於0）或向上（大於0）移動，避免遮住第1格。",
  ["Nudges it left (below 0) or right (above 0), in pixels, so it doesn't cover slot 1."] = "以像素向左（小於0）或向右（大於0）移動，避免遮住第1格。",
  ["Only for Discipline Priests: spread Atonement before big group damage."] = "僅限戒律牧師：在大範圍團隊傷害前鋪開救贖。",
  ["Optional lines and decoration around the icons."] = "圖示周圍可選的線條和裝飾。",
  ["Out of combat, hide the icons while you're mounted."] = "脫戰時騎乘坐騎會隱藏圖示。",
  ["Position"] = "位置",
  ["Potion: %s. Shown in the items icon when SimC uses a potion (with your big cooldowns). Right-click the box to remove it."] = "藥水：%s。當 SimC 使用藥水時（配合你的大冷卻）顯示在物品圖示中。右鍵點擊方框可移除。",
  ["Potion: drag a potion from your bags onto this box to add it to your rotation (this spec only). It shows in the items icon when SimC uses a potion."] = "藥水：把背包裡的藥水拖到這個方框，即可加入你的循環（僅限此專精）。當 SimC 使用藥水時會顯示在物品圖示中。",
  ["Profiles"] = "設定檔",
  ["Settings can be shared by all your characters (Default) or kept for this character only."] = "設定可以由所有角色共用（預設），也可以只為此角色儲存。",
  ["Setup and reset"] = "設定和重置",
  ["Show a defensive cooldown (Barkskin, Shield Wall, Survival of the Fittest...) in the defensive icon when you need one."] = "需要時在防禦圖示中顯示防禦技能（樹皮術、盾牆、適者生存……）。",
  ["Show the key that casts each spell on its icon."] = "在每個圖示上顯示施放該法術的按鍵。",
  ["Show the spells to press. Off hides the icons completely (the key binding and /dmga on | off do the same)."] = "顯示要按的法術。關閉則完全隱藏圖示（按鍵繫結和 /dmga on | off 也一樣）。",
  ["Show your interrupt (Kick, Pummel, Wind Shear...) in slot 1 when your target casts something interruptible."] = "目標施放可打斷的法術時，在第1格顯示你的打斷技能（腳踢、拳擊、風剪……）。",
  ["Show your on-use trinkets when they are ready, in combat, at the moments SimC uses them (with your cooldowns)."] = "在戰鬥中、SimC 使用它們的時刻（配合你的冷卻）顯示已就緒的主動飾品。",
  ["Shows, for 8 seconds, the defensive DMGAssist would suggest before a big hit, in the defensive icon."] = "在防禦圖示中顯示8秒鐘：大傷害前 DMGAssist 會推薦的防禦技能。",
  ["Single target or AoE"] = "單體或群體",
  ["Size"] = "大小",
  ["Size and spacing"] = "大小和間距",
  ["Some cooldowns are saved or spent depending on how long the fight is expected to last."] = "一些冷卻會根據預計的戰鬥時長保留或使用。",
  ["Space after the main icon"] = "主圖示後的間距",
  ["Stack counter"] = "層數計數",
  ["The color of the key text."] = "按鍵文字的顏色。",
  ["The color of the spell names."] = "法術名稱的顏色。",
  ["The font for keybinds, spell names and labels on the icons."] = "圖示上按鍵、法術名稱和標籤使用的字型。",
  ["The game's own rotation helper. DMGAssist asks it about things the game hides from addons."] = "遊戲內建的循環助手。DMGAssist 會向它詢問遊戲對插件隱藏的資訊。",
  ["The size of everything at once, icons and text."] = "所有內容的大小，包括圖示和文字。",
  ["The size of slot 1, the spell to press now."] = "第1格（現在要按的法術）的大小。",
  ["The size of slots 2 and 3, what comes next."] = "第2、3格（接下來的）的大小。",
  ["The size of the callout text."] = "提示文字的大小。",
  ["The size of the key text."] = "按鍵文字的大小。",
  ["The size of the spell names."] = "法術名稱的大小。",
  ["The size of the stack number."] = "層數數字的大小。",
  ["The sound played for this alert."] = "此提醒播放的聲音。",
  ["The space between each icon."] = "每個圖示之間的間距。",
  ["The space between the icons and the frame's edge (visible with a background or border)."] = "圖示與框架邊緣的間距（有背景或邊框時可見）。",
  ["The spell's name under each icon."] = "每個圖示下方的法術名稱。",
  ["The text on and under the icons."] = "圖示上和下方的文字。",
  ["Tools for finding out why DMGAssist picked something, and for reporting a problem."] = "用於查明 DMGAssist 為何做出某個選擇以及回報問題的工具。",
  ["Trinkets you activate yourself. A ready one appears in the gold-edged items icon on slot 1 (bottom-left by default); press it alongside slot 1."] = "你自己啟用的飾品。就緒時出現在第1格的金色邊框物品圖示中（預設左下）；與第1格一起按。",
  ["Turn DMGAssist on or off, move it, and pick its language. Everything else is on the pages below: Combat (what it recommends), Display (how it looks), Sounds, Integrations, Advanced."] = "開啟或關閉 DMGAssist、移動它並選擇語言。其他內容都在下面的頁面：戰鬥（推薦什麼）、顯示（外觀）、聲音、整合、進階。",
  ["Used when \"Fight length\" is Custom: the fight length assumed, in seconds."] = "當「戰鬥時長」為自訂時使用：假定的戰鬥時長（秒）。",
  ["What to recommend"] = "推薦內容",
  ["When the icons show"] = "何時顯示圖示",
  ["Where DMGAssist finds the key for each spell: Blizzard's bars, Bartender, ElvUI, Dominos."] = "DMGAssist 從哪裡取得每個法術的按鍵：暴雪快捷列、Bartender、ElvUI、Dominos。",
  ["Where the key text sits on the icon."] = "按鍵文字在圖示上的位置。",
  ["Where the stack number sits."] = "層數數字的位置。",
  ["Which part of slot 1 it sits on. Bottom-left by default."] = "位於第1格的哪個位置。預設左下。",
  ["Which part of slot 1 it sits on. Top-left by default."] = "位於第1格的哪個位置。預設左上。",
  ["Your interrupt takes slot 1 when an enemy casts something worth stopping."] = "敵人施放值得打斷的法術時，你的打斷技能會佔據第1格。",
  ["Top-left corner"] = "左上角",
  ["Bottom-left corner"] = "左下角",
  ["Bottom-right corner"] = "右下角",
  ["Settings open as soon as the game allows it (after combat)."] = "遊戲允許後（戰鬥結束後）將立即開啟設定。",
  ["No potions in your bags"] = "背包裡沒有藥水",
  ["Potion for this spec"] = "此專精的藥水",
  ["Potion removed for this spec."] = "已移除此專精的藥水。",
  ["Potion set for this spec: %s."] = "此專精的藥水：%s。",
  ["Potion: %s. Shown in the items icon when SimC uses a potion (with your big cooldowns). Click the box to change it, right-click to remove it."] = "藥水：%s。當 SimC 使用藥水時（配合你的大冷卻）顯示在物品圖示中。點擊方框可更換，右鍵可移除。",
  ["Potion: click this box and pick one of the potions in your bags to add it to your rotation (this spec only). It shows in the items icon when SimC uses a potion."] = "藥水：點擊這個方框，從背包裡的藥水中選擇一個加入你的循環（僅限此專精）。當 SimC 使用藥水時會顯示在物品圖示中。",
  ["Type /dmga potion and shift-click a potion to choose it."] = "輸入 /dmga potion 並按住 Shift 點擊藥水即可選擇。",
  ["choose the potion for this spec (shift-click it), or /dmga potion off"] = "選擇此專精的藥水（按住 Shift 點擊），或 /dmga potion off",
  ["Addons DMGAssist works with:"] = "DMGAssist 可搭配使用的插件：",
  ["Check"] = "檢查",
  ["DMGAssist works with these when they are installed, with nothing to set up: Masque skins its icons, ElvUI, Bartender and Dominos bars give the keybinds, Titan Panel and ElvUI get a launcher, WeakAuras can read its picks."] = "安裝後 DMGAssist 會自動搭配這些插件，無需設定：Masque 為圖示換膚，ElvUI、Bartender 和 Dominos 的快捷列提供按鍵，Titan Panel 和 ElvUI 獲得啟動按鈕，WeakAuras 可以讀取推薦。",
  ["Lists in chat each supported addon: in use, found, or not installed (also /dmga addons)."] = "在聊天中列出每個支援的插件：使用中、已找到或未安裝（也可用 /dmga addons）。",
  ["Other addons"] = "其他插件",
  ["Other addons in use"] = "正在使用的其他插件",
  ["Preview. Back in its place when you close the settings."] = "預覽。關閉設定後會回到原位。",
  ["Which addons are in use"] = "哪些插件正在使用",
  ["icon skins"] = "圖示外觀",
  ["keybinds read from its bars"] = "從其快捷列讀取按鍵",
  ["keybinds from its bars, data text launcher"] = "從其快捷列讀取按鍵，資訊文字啟動按鈕",
  ["launcher in Titan Panel"] = "Titan Panel 中的啟動按鈕",
  ["boss mod warnings"] = "首領插件警報",
  ["can read DMGAssist's picks (DMGAssistAPI)"] = "可以讀取 DMGAssist 的推薦（DMGAssistAPI）",
  ["in use"] = "使用中",
  ["found"] = "已找到",
  ["which supported addons (Masque, ElvUI, Bartender, boss mods...) are found and in use"] = "哪些支援的插件（Masque、ElvUI、Bartender、首領插件……）已找到並在使用",
  ["Written and maintained by %s"] = "作者與維護者：%s",
  ["linked"] = "已連結",
  ["Move the HUD in Blizzard's Edit Mode. Masque skins the icons. With a controller, keybinds show as its buttons (Display > Controller button names). Addon authors: DMGAssistAPI."] = "在暴雪的編輯模式中移動 HUD。Masque 可美化圖示。使用控制器時，按鍵顯示為控制器按鈕（顯示 > 控制器按鍵名稱）。插件作者：DMGAssistAPI。",
  ["DMGAssist works with these when they are installed, with nothing to set up: Masque skins its icons, boss mods time defensives and interrupts, WeakAuras can read its picks."] = "安裝後 DMGAssist 會自動搭配這些插件，無需設定：Masque 為圖示換膚，首領插件為防禦和打斷提供時機，WeakAuras 可以讀取推薦。",
  ["Accuracy"] = "準確度",
  ["After each real fight, a grade from S+ to D pops up above the icons, with four parts: accuracy, always casting, reaction and cooldowns."] = "每場真實戰鬥結束後，圖示上方會彈出 S+ 到 D 的評級，包含四項：準確度、持續施法、反應速度和冷卻使用。",
  ["Always casting"] = "持續施法",
  ["Average of the last %d"] = "最近 %d 場平均",
  ["Best"] = "最佳",
  ["Best grade, trend and where to improve for the spec you are in: see Grade report below Performance grade."] = "目前專精的最佳評級、趨勢和改進方向：見「表現評級」下的「評級報告」。",
  ["Clears the best grade and history of the spec you are in. Other specs keep theirs."] = "清除目前專精的最佳評級和紀錄。其他專精保留各自的紀錄。",
  ["Cooldowns"] = "冷卻使用",
  ["Drag the grade where you want it while the icons are unlocked or in Edit Mode; a sample shows while you do."] = "在圖示解鎖或編輯模式下，把評級拖到你想要的位置；拖動時會顯示範例。",
  ["End-of-fight grade"] = "戰鬥結束評級",
  ["Fight grade"] = "戰鬥評級",
  ["Fights shorter than this aren't graded, so trash pulls and a quick hit on a critter don't count."] = "短於此時長的戰鬥不評級，清小怪或隨手打一下小動物都不算。",
  ["Forget every spec's grades"] = "清除所有專精的評級",
  ["Forget this spec's grades"] = "清除此專精的評級",
  ["Grade report"] = "評級報告",
  ["Grade stays on screen"] = "評級顯示時長",
  ["Grades every fight that lasts long enough: how often you pressed what slot 1 showed, how little time slot 1 sat ready, how fast you pressed it, and how quickly cooldowns were used. It never measures damage. Off: nothing is tracked or shown."] = "為每場夠長的戰鬥評級：你按下 1 號位所示技能的頻率、1 號位就緒卻閒置的時間有多短、你按得有多快、冷卻技能用得有多及時。從不衡量傷害。關閉：不記錄也不顯示。",
  ["Grades for this spec forgotten."] = "已清除此專精的評級。",
  ["How long the grade stays before it fades out. It pops in quickly and fades in under a second."] = "評級淡出前停留的時長。它會快速彈出，並在一秒內淡出。",
  ["How your fights went in the spec you are in. Only fights long enough to grade count."] = "你目前專精的戰鬥表現。只計入夠長的戰鬥。",
  ["Last %d fights (newest last)"] = "最近 %d 場戰鬥（最新在後）",
  ["Moves the grade back to its default place, just above the three icons."] = "把評級移回預設位置，即三個圖示正上方。",
  ["New best!"] = "新紀錄！",
  ["No graded fights yet for this spec. Fight something for 20 seconds or more."] = "此專精還沒有評級的戰鬥。戰鬥 20 秒或更久即可。",
  ["Nothing to improve: keep it up."] = "無需改進：保持下去。",
  ["Performance grade"] = "表現評級",
  ["Pops up a sample grade the way a real one shows, to check its place and how long it stays."] = "像真實評級一樣彈出範例評級，以檢查位置和停留時長。",
  ["Put the grade back above the icons"] = "把評級放回圖示上方",
  ["Reaction"] = "反應速度",
  ["Reset"] = "重置",
  ["Shortest fight to grade"] = "最短評級戰鬥時長",
  ["Show a sample grade"] = "顯示範例評級",
  ["Show the grade after fights"] = "戰鬥後顯示評級",
  ["Tip: press as the flash comes, or a little before: the game queues a press made just before it's ready."] = "提示：在閃光出現時或稍早按下：遊戲會把就緒前片刻的按鍵排入佇列。",
  ["Tip: press what slot 1 shows; slots 2 and 3 are what comes after it."] = "提示：按 1 號位顯示的技能；2 號和 3 號位是之後的技能。",
  ["Tip: slot 1 asked for %s %d times when you pressed something else."] = "提示：你按了別的技能時，1 號位要求 %s 共 %d 次。",
  ["Tip: slot 1 was ready for %.1f s without a press. Keep the global cooldown rolling."] = "提示：1 號位就緒了 %.1f 秒卻沒有按下。保持公共冷卻不停轉。",
  ["Tip: use major cooldowns, trinkets and your potion as soon as they show."] = "提示：主要冷卻、飾品和藥水一出現就使用。",
  ["Trend"] = "趨勢",
  ["Where to improve"] = "改進方向",
  ["Your results"] = "你的成績",
  ["improving"] = "上升",
  ["slipping"] = "下滑",
  ["steady"] = "穩定",
  ["Sample grade"] = "範例評級",
  ["Default place"] = "預設位置",
  ["This spec's history"] = "此專精的紀錄",
  ["Left of slot 1, top"] = "1 號位左側，上方",
  ["Left of slot 1, bottom"] = "1 號位左側，下方",
  ["For tank specs, slots 1-3 stay your damage rotation and your mitigation shows in the defensive icon, timed to how your spec tanks."] = "坦克專精的 1-3 號位保持傷害循環，減傷技能顯示在防禦圖示中，依你的專精坦克方式安排時機。",
  ["For the tank spec you are in: at or below this much health your emergency button (Last Stand, Frenzied Regeneration, Vampiric Blood...) shows. Saved per spec."] = "目前坦克專精：生命值等於或低於此值時顯示緊急按鈕（破釜沉舟、狂暴回復、吸血鬼之血……）。依專精儲存。",
  ["Mitigation"] = "減傷",
  ["Tank low health"] = "坦克低生命值",
  ["Tank mitigation in the defensive icon"] = "在防禦圖示中顯示坦克減傷",
  ["Tanks"] = "坦克",
  ["Tip: press your mitigation (the red icon) as soon as it shows; it's timed to keep you safe."] = "提示：減傷（紅色圖示）一出現就按；它的時機是為了保護你。",
  ["While you hold aggro, the defensive icon shows your keep-up buttons when they're due (Shield Block, Demon Spikes, Shield of the Righteous...), cooldowns before big hits your boss mod warns about, and Spell Reflection or Anti-Magic Shell for spells cast at you. Off: SimC's list decides, as for other specs."] = "你持有仇恨時，防禦圖示會在需要時顯示維持類按鈕（盾牌格擋、惡魔尖刺、正義聖盾……），在首領插件預警的重擊前顯示冷卻技能，並在有法術針對你時顯示法術反射或反魔法護罩。關閉：與其他專精一樣由 SimC 清單決定。",
  ["%s (several targets)"] = "%s（多目標）",
  ["%s: left to Blizzard's assistant (its cooldown moves with effects we can't see)"] = "%s：交給暴雪助手（其冷卻會受我們看不到的效果影響）",
  ["%s: measured %d times, our clock corrected by %+.1f s, now within %.1f s"] = "%s：測量 %d 次，時鐘修正 %+.1f 秒，現在誤差 %.1f 秒",
  ["Nothing yet: it learns from your fights."] = "暫無：它會從你的戰鬥中學習。",
  ["What DMGAssist learned for this spec"] = "DMGAssist 為此專精學到的內容",
  ["One line of advice on your weakest part, worded differently from fight to fight. Off: the grade and its parts only."] = "關於你最弱一項的一句建議，每場戰鬥換種說法。關閉：只顯示評級和各項。",
  ["Show a tip under the grade"] = "在評級下顯示提示",
  ["Tip: %s came up in slot 1 %d times and something else got pressed. Give it the priority."] = "提示：%s 在 1 號位出現了 %d 次，卻按了別的。優先按它。",
  ["Tip: watch for %s - slot 1 wanted it %d times this fight."] = "提示：留意 %s——這場戰鬥中 1 號位要求了它 %d 次。",
  ["Tip: slot 1 is always the next press. Slots 2 and 3 are a preview, not a choice."] = "提示：1 號位永遠是下一個要按的。2 號和 3 號位是預覽，不是選項。",
  ["Tip: follow slot 1 in order; the priority already accounts for your procs and cooldowns."] = "提示：依順序跟著 1 號位；優先順序已考慮你的觸發效果和冷卻。",
  ["Tip: if two spells look good, trust slot 1 - it's the one that does the most right now."] = "提示：兩個技能看起來都不錯時，相信 1 號位——它是當下收益最高的。",
  ["Tip: %.1f s went by with a spell ready and nothing pressed. Something to press is almost always there."] = "提示：有技能就緒卻 %.1f 秒沒有按鍵。幾乎總有可以按的。",
  ["Tip: you lost %.1f s of casting this fight. Press the next spell as the last one finishes."] = "提示：這場戰鬥你損失了 %.1f 秒施法時間。上一個技能結束時就按下一個。",
  ["Tip: keep a button going at all times; even a filler beats waiting."] = "提示：始終保持有鍵在按；即使是填充技能也比等待好。",
  ["Tip: when you have to move, use instant spells so the casting doesn't stop."] = "提示：需要移動時，用瞬發技能保持施法不斷。",
  ["Tip: you can press a moment before slot 1 is ready; the game queues it for you."] = "提示：你可以在 1 號位就緒前一瞬按下；遊戲會替你排隊。",
  ["Tip: watch the sweep on slot 1 and press as it closes, not after."] = "提示：看著 1 號位的轉圈，在它合上時按，而不是之後。",
  ["Tip: a key close to your hand makes slot 1 quicker to press."] = "提示：把鍵放在手邊，按 1 號位會更快。",
  ["Tip: react to the flash on slot 1; every small pause adds up over a fight."] = "提示：對 1 號位的閃光做出反應；每個小停頓在整場戰鬥中都會累積。",
  ["Tip: a cooldown sitting ready is damage lost. Press it when slot 1 shows it."] = "提示：就緒卻閒置的冷卻就是損失的傷害。1 號位顯示時就按。",
  ["Tip: cooldowns come back sooner the sooner you use them."] = "提示：冷卻越早用，越早回來。",
  ["Tip: bind your cooldowns where you can reach them in a hurry."] = "提示：把冷卻技能放在急用時能立刻按到的地方。",
  ["Tip: when slot 1 shows a cooldown it's already lined up with your other buffs: press it."] = "提示：1 號位顯示冷卻時，它已經與你的其他增益對齊：按下去。",
  ["Tip: keep your mitigation rolling: press the red icon as it lights up, before the hits land."] = "提示：保持減傷：紅色圖示一亮就按，在重擊到來之前。",
  ["Tip: tanking is timing. The red icon shows your mitigation exactly when it's due."] = "提示：坦克靠時機。紅色圖示恰好在需要時顯示你的減傷。",
  ["Tip: late mitigation means a big hit taken. Keep an eye on the red icon."] = "提示：減傷晚了就會吃到重擊。留意紅色圖示。",
  ["Nothing to improve: that was clean."] = "無需改進：乾淨俐落。",
  ["Great fight: every part was on point."] = "精彩的戰鬥：每一項都很到位。",
  ["Nothing to fix this time. Try it on a harder target."] = "這次沒什麼要改的。試試更難的目標。",
  ["Settings: press Esc, choose Options, then the AddOns tab > DMGAssist."] = "設定：按 Esc，選擇「選項」，再進入「插件」分頁 > DMGAssist。",
  ["Accuracy, Always casting, Reaction and Cooldowns (and Mitigation for tanks) under the bar."] = "在條下顯示準確度、持續施法、反應速度和冷卻使用（坦克還有減傷）。",
  ["Grade size"] = "評級大小",
  ["How see-through the box behind the grade is. 0% = no box at all, only the letters and numbers."] = "評級背後框的透明度。0% = 沒有框，只有字母和數字。",
  ["Makes the whole grade bigger or smaller."] = "放大或縮小整個評級。",
  ["Outlines the real action button for slot 1's spell on your bars (Blizzard's, Bartender, ElvUI, Dominos) in DMGAssist's magenta, so it never looks like Blizzard's own gold or blue highlights."] = "用 DMGAssist 的洋紅色描邊你快捷列上（暴雪、Bartender、ElvUI、Dominos）1 號位技能的實際按鈕，避免與暴雪內建的金色或藍色高亮混淆。",
  ["Show the grade bar"] = "顯示評級條",
  ["Show the parts"] = "顯示各項",
  ["The coloured D-to-S+ bar with a marker that slides to your score."] = "從 D 到 S+ 的彩色條，標記會滑到你的分數。",
  ["%d extras"] = "額外 %d 次",
  ["Beyond Assisted Combat: %d%% of the fight"] = "超越輔助戰鬥：戰鬥的 %d%%",
  ["How much of the fight slot 1 showed something other than Blizzard's Assisted Combat, and why: cooldowns timed by SimC, a different core spell (SimC's priority), DoTs and buffs kept up, utility (interrupts, defensives, gap closers), plus extras Blizzard never shows (the off-GCD badge, trinkets). It shows where DMGAssist plays differently, not damage: addons can't read damage done."] = "戰鬥中 1 號位顯示與暴雪輔助戰鬥不同內容的比例及原因：由 SimC 掌握時機的冷卻技能、不同的核心法術（SimC 的優先順序）、維持的持續傷害和增益、輔助（打斷、防禦、突進），以及暴雪從不顯示的額外項目（不佔共用冷卻的圖示、飾品）。它顯示 DMGAssist 打法不同之處，而非傷害：插件無法讀取造成的傷害。",
  ["Show Beyond Assisted Combat"] = "顯示「超越輔助戰鬥」",
  ["cooldowns %d%%"] = "冷卻 %d%%",
  ["rotation %d%%"] = "循環 %d%%",
  ["upkeep %d%%"] = "維持 %d%%",
  ["utility %d%%"] = "輔助 %d%%",
  ["GO"] = "出手",
  ["HOLD"] = "等待",
  ["HOLD during channels"] = "引導期間顯示等待",
  ["While one of your channeled spells runs (Spinning Crane Kick, Fists of Fury, Mind Flay...), slot 1 shows an amber HOLD: pressing anything now would cut it short. A green GO shows the moment it ends. Channels your spec's priority list cuts short on purpose get no HOLD."] = "當你的引導法術進行中（神鶴引項踢、怒雷破、精神鞭笞等），1 號位顯示琥珀色的「等待」：此時按任何鍵都會打斷它。結束的那一刻會顯示綠色的「出手」。你的專精優先順序清單刻意打斷的引導不會顯示「等待」。",
  ["While one of your channeled spells runs (Spinning Crane Kick, Fists of Fury, Mind Flay...), slot 1 shows an amber HOLD: pressing anything now would cut it short. Its border flashes green the moment it ends."] = "當你的引導法術進行中（神鶴引項踢、怒雷破、精神鞭笞等），1 號位顯示琥珀色的「等待」：此時按任何鍵都會打斷它。結束的那一刻邊框會閃綠光。",
  ["Atonements kept up"] = "保持的救贖數",
  ["Discipline Priest and Mistweaver Monk: healing that comes from your rotation, while you deal damage."] = "戒律牧師和織霧武僧：你打傷害時，來自循環的治療。",
  ["Healers in groups"] = "小隊中的治療者",
  ["Healing support"] = "治療支援",
  ["Hunter's Mark on bosses"] = "首領身上的獵人印記",
  ["Hunters: with a boss targeted (before the pull too), Hunter's Mark comes first in slot 1 until it is on it."] = "獵人：目標是首領時（開怪前也算），獵人印記排在第 1 格，直到印記掛上。",
  ["In a party or raid: Discipline keeps Atonement up all the time (Shield, or Radiance when several are missing); Mistweaver casts Renewing Mist whenever a charge is ready. Solo, nothing changes."] = "在小隊或團隊中：戒律始終保持救贖（盾，缺幾個時用耀）；織霧只要有一層充能就施放復甦之霧。單人時不變。",
  ["With healing support: this many Atonements, counted from your casts, between big hits."] = "開啟治療支援時：在大傷害之間保持這麼多救贖（按你的施法計數）。",
  ["%s is in slot 1 but isn't on your action bars. Drag it from the spellbook (hero talent spells are on a later page) onto a bar and give it a key, or hide it on the Spells & trinkets page."] = "%s 在第 1 格，但不在你的快捷列上。從法術書（英雄天賦法術在後面的頁面）拖到快捷列上並綁定按鍵，或在「法術與飾品」頁面隱藏它。",
  ["%s is in slot 1 but its button has no key. Bind one (Options > Keybindings) or press it from your bar."] = "%s 在第 1 格，但它的按鈕沒有按鍵。綁定一個（選項 > 按鍵設定），或從快捷列上點擊。",
  ["Fights less than 10 seconds apart (questing, mob to mob) are graded together: one grade 10 seconds after the last, or every 3 minutes on a long run, instead of one after every mob. Short fights add up, so they get graded too. Bosses are graded at once."] = "間隔不到 10 秒的戰鬥（解任務、一隻接一隻打怪）會合併評分：在最後一場結束 10 秒後評一次分，長時間連續戰鬥則每 3 分鐘評一次，而不是每隻怪評一次。短戰鬥會累加，因此也能獲得評分。首領戰立即評分。",
  ["Group quick fights"] = "合併短戰鬥",
  ["%s is shown in a small icon (defensive or off-GCD) but has no key. Put it on a bar and give it a key, or hide it on the Spells & trinkets page."] = "%s 顯示在小圖示中（減傷或不佔共用冷卻），但沒有按鍵。把它放到快捷列上並綁定按鍵，或在「法術與飾品」頁面隱藏它。",
  ["%s is in your rotation but isn't on your action bars, so DMGAssist skips it. Drag it from the spellbook onto a bar (and give it a key) to have it suggested."] = "%s 在你的循環中，但不在你的快捷列上，因此 DMGAssist 會跳過它。把它從法術書拖到快捷列上（並綁定按鍵）即可被推薦。",
  ["Only spells on your bars"] = "只推薦快捷列上的技能",
  ["A spell that isn't on any of your action bars is never suggested: the next one takes its place, and chat says which spell once. Off: every spell you know can be suggested."] = "不在任何快捷列上的技能永遠不會被推薦：由下一個技能替代，聊天框會提示一次是哪個技能。關閉：你會的所有技能都可能被推薦。",
  ["%s is missing (Blizzard's assistant asks for it), so DMGAssist shows it until you apply it. Ignore it and it goes away for the rest of the fight."] = "缺少%s（暴雪助手要求使用），DMGAssist會一直顯示直到你施放。忽略它，本場戰鬥剩餘時間內將不再顯示。",
  ["Suggest a defensive at least this long before a big hit that a boss mod announces. Defensives that last longer show earlier, so you have time to press it and the hit lands well inside it."] = "在首領插件預告的大傷害前至少這麼久建議使用減傷技能。持續時間更長的減傷會更早顯示，讓你有時間按下，並且傷害穩穩落在其持續時間內。",
  ["Wrong-key hint"] = "按錯鍵提示",
  ["When you press the key right next to the one slot 1 showed (5 instead of 6), or forget its Shift / Ctrl / Alt, slot 1 shows both keys for a moment, like \"5 » 6\". A slip that keeps happening becomes the fight's tip."] = "當你按了1號位所示按鍵旁邊的鍵（按了5而不是6），或漏按 Shift / Ctrl / Alt 時，1號位會短暫顯示兩個按鍵，例如「5 » 6」。反覆出現的誤按會成為本場戰鬥的提示。",
  ["Tip: you pressed %s %d times when slot 1 showed %s (%s). If that key is hard to reach, move the spell to one that's easier to hit."] = "提示：你按了 %s 共 %d 次，而1號位顯示的是 %s（%s）。如果這個鍵不好按，把該技能移到更順手的鍵上。",
  ["Game mode"] = "遊戲模式",
